 From this day on, whenever I ever find a wand of cancellation, I will 
either leave it be, or, if I take it with me, I will name it 
"BEWARE!!!!!!!!!"

You see, I have figured out that the most deadly you can ever become is 
by being a Samurai double-weaponing (expertly) Frost Brand (expertly) 
