holding. Unfortunately, Frost Brand got into the bag _before_ the wand 
of cancellation (unidentified at the time). That game was no fun 
anymore, my plan was spoiled, carelessness killed me shortly.

THIS time around everything proceeds smoothly, I clean out the castle 
